| description = In Neriak 3rd Gate can be found the Hall of the guild Ebon Mask. 
The [[Rogue]] guildmaster [[Eolorn J`Axx]] has led his guild to have more than a few enemies.  
Members of Ebon Mask can expect less than warm welcome from the following:

*The [[Guards of Qeynos]]
*The Barbarian Warriors of Halas called the [[Wolves of the North]]
*The Halfling Warriors of Rivervale called the [[Guardians of the Vale]]
*The Leader of Highpass [[Carson McCabe]].

Many other factions than this also oppose the Ebon Mask.  Somehow though the Ebon Mask does not have a shortage of new recruits.

